01_setup.rb as a secret-looking value. It is the SHA1 hash of the default admin password 'admin', which doc/INSTALL documents and which Redmine forces users to change at first login. It is not a real secret, and the migration may not be changed, so this check stays partial.\n- full-gate: Left out of bin/harness check: system tests (bin/harness test-system, need Chrome and a Mermaid.js download), the Bazaar non-ASCII test (needs the en_US.ISO8859-1 locale), bundle audit (needs network), and the PostgreSQL/MySQL and Ruby 3.3/3.4 matrix. The upstream workflows tests.yml and linters.yml still run all of them.\n- ci: The uw-harness package is not published on npm (npx -y uw-harness returned 404 here), so the new harness.yml workflow will fail until it is published. The gates were checked with the local build of uw-harness (check passes) and run directly from a clean shell.\n- deploy-explicit: Without human answers, docs/deploy.md and docs/observability.md keep open TODO blocks, so these two checks stay partial.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0179qFFDWmyXLkYtEzWQxw7E","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
